            "text": "Blink maps lang to the inherited -webkit-locale presentation property, but hostile-style neutralization with all: initial clears it. Restore the quoted locale after neutralization so FontDescription::GetScript reads the row language.",
            "markdown": "Blink maps lang to the inherited -webkit-locale presentation property, but hostile-style neutralization with all: initial clears it. Restore the quoted locale after neutralization so FontDescription::GetScript reads the row language."
          },
          "locations": [
