          "message": {
            "text": "DM-2593: parent-readable child frames share the Page renderer Settings, so skip attempting a separate CDP target session for them. Only inaccessible/OOPIF children need the independent Settings consistency probe.",
            "markdown": "DM-2593: parent-readable child frames share the Page renderer Settings, so skip attempting a separate CDP target session for them. Only inaccessible/OOPIF children need the independent Settings consistency probe."
